* {{alt|en|trepeget||obsolete}}{{attn|en|Is this really an alternative form and not a synonym?}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|fro|trebuchet}}, {{m|fro|trebuket}} et al. (modern {{m|fr|trébuchet}}), from {{m|fro|trebuchier|t=to overthrow, topple}}, from {{m|fro|tre-}} + {{m|fro|*buchier}}, from {{der|en|fro|buc|t=trunk of the body}}, from Old {{der|en|frk|*buk|*būk|t=belly, trunk, torso}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*būkaz|t=belly, abdomen, trunk}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*bʰōw-|t=to blow, swell}}. Cognate with {{cog|goh|būh|t=belly}}, {{cog|ang|būc|t=belly, trunk}}. More at {{m|en|bouk}}.

